{"seq":4,"slug":"dynamic-context-injection","title":"动态上下文注入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/system-prompt-design/dynamic-context-injection","wordCount":1062,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"动态上下文注入\">动态上下文注入</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>动态上下文注入（Dynamic Context Injection）是在运行时将外部信息动态插入到提示词中的技术。与静态系统提示词不同，动态上下文根据每次请求的具体条件实时构建，使模型能够基于最新、最相关的信息进行推理。这是 RAG（检索增强生成）和 Agent 系统的核心基础设施。</p>\n<p>值得了解的术语演进：2025 年以来，这一实践领域已从 prompt engineering 扩展出 <strong>context engineering</strong>（上下文工程）的说法——Anthropic 工程团队在《Effective context engineering for AI agents》中系统阐述了这一视角：核心不再是单条提示的措辞技巧，而是把系统提示、检索内容、工具结果、对话历史当作一个有限预算的「记忆系统」来整体设计与维护（<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/effective-context-engineering-for-ai-agents\">anthropic.com/engineering</a>）。本文介绍的动态注入、Token 预算与压缩策略，正是 context engineering 的核心构件。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[用户请求] --&gt; B[上下文引擎]&#10;    B --&gt; C[检索模块]&#10;    B --&gt; D[状态模块]&#10;    B --&gt; E[环境模块]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[向量检索]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[关键词搜索]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[对话历史]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[用户画像]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[时间/地理]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[系统状态]&#10;    C1 --&gt; F[上下文组装]&#10;    C2 --&gt; F&#10;    D1 --&gt; F&#10;    D2 --&gt; F&#10;    E1 --&gt; F&#10;    E2 --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[完整提示词]\">graph LR\n    A[用户请求] --&gt; B[上下文引擎]\n    B --&gt; C[检索模块]\n    B --&gt; D[状态模块]\n    B --&gt; E[环境模块]\n    C --&gt; C1[向量检索]\n    C --&gt; C2[关键词搜索]\n    D --&gt; D1[对话历史]\n    D --&gt; D2[用户画像]\n    E --&gt; E1[时间/地理]\n    E --&gt; E2[系统状态]\n    C1 --&gt; F[上下文组装]\n    C2 --&gt; F\n    D1 --&gt; F\n    D2 --&gt; F\n    E1 --&gt; F\n    E2 --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[完整提示词]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>上下文类型</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n<th>Token 占比</th>\n<th>注入位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>检索文档</td>\n<td>向量数据库/搜索引擎</td>\n<td>每次请求</td>\n<td>30-60%</td>\n<td>用户消息之前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对话历史</td>\n<td>会话存储</td>\n<td>每轮对话</td>\n<td>10-30%</td>\n<td>消息序列中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户画像</td>\n<td>用户数据库</td>\n<td>每次会话</td>\n<td>5-10%</td>\n<td>系统提示词尾部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境信息</td>\n<td>系统运行时</td>\n<td>每次请求</td>\n<td>3-5%</td>\n<td>系统提示词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具结果</td>\n<td>API/函数调用</td>\n<td>按需</td>\n<td>10-30%</td>\n<td>助手消息之后</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>动态上下文注入的核心挑战是在有限的 Token 窗口中最大化信息价值——选择最相关的信息、去除冗余、保持上下文连贯性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"检索上下文注入\">检索上下文注入</h2><p>检索上下文是 RAG 系统的核心组件。通过语义检索找到与用户问题最相关的文档片段，注入到提示中供模型参考。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RetrievedChunk {&#10;  content: string;&#10;  source: string;&#10;  score: number;&#10;  metadata: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ContextInjectionConfig {&#10;  maxTokens: number;&#10;  maxChunks: number;&#10;  minScore: number;&#10;  deduplicationThreshold: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const buildRetrievalContext = (chunks: RetrievedChunk[], config: ContextInjectionConfig): string =&gt; {&#10;  const filtered = chunks.filter((c) =&gt; c.score &gt;= config.minScore).slice(0, config.maxChunks);&#10;&#10;  const deduplicated = deduplicateChunks(filtered, config.deduplicationThreshold);&#10;&#10;  let totalTokens = 0;&#10;  const selected: RetrievedChunk[] = [];&#10;&#10;  for (const chunk of deduplicated) {&#10;    const chunkTokens = estimateTokens(chunk.content);&#10;    if (totalTokens + chunkTokens &gt; config.maxTokens) break;&#10;    selected.push(chunk);&#10;    totalTokens += chunkTokens;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return selected.map((c, i) =&gt; `[参考文档 ${i + 1}] (来源: ${c.source})\\n${c.content}`).join(&#39;\\n\\n&#39;);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RetrievedChunk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  content</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  metadata</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ContextInjectionConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxTokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxChunks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  minScore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  deduplicationThreshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildRetrievalContext</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">chunks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RetrievedChunk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ContextInjectionConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> filtered</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chunks.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.minScore).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, config.maxChunks);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> deduplicated</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deduplicateChunks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(filtered, config.deduplicationThreshold);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalTokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> selected</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RetrievedChunk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> chunk</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deduplicated) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> chunkTokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> estimateTokens</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(chunk.content);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (totalTokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chunkTokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.maxTokens) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    selected.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(chunk);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    totalTokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chunkTokens;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> selected.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `[参考文档 ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}] (来源: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">c</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">source</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">})</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">c</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">content</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注入检索上下文的提示模板：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"基于以下参考文档回答用户问题。如果参考文档中没有相关信息，请明确说明。&#10;&#10;{检索到的文档片段}&#10;&#10;规则：&#10;1. 优先使用参考文档中的信息&#10;2. 引用信息时标注来源编号，如 [参考文档 1]&#10;3. 如果多个文档信息矛盾，指出差异并给出综合判断&#10;4. 不要编造参考文档中没有的事实&#10;&#10;用户问题：{用户输入}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>基于以下参考文档回答用户问题。如果参考文档中没有相关信息，请明确说明。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{检索到的文档片段}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>规则：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. 优先使用参考文档中的信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 引用信息时标注来源编号，如 [参考文档 1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 如果多个文档信息矛盾，指出差异并给出综合判断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 不要编造参考文档中没有的事实</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>用户问题：{用户输入}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"对话历史管理\">对话历史管理</h2><p>对话历史是多轮对话中最关键的动态上下文。有效的历史管理策略需要在保留必要信息和控制 Token 消耗之间取得平衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[完整对话历史] --&gt; B{历史管理策略}&#10;    B --&gt; C[滑动窗口]&#10;    B --&gt; D[摘要压缩]&#10;    B --&gt; E[选择性保留]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[保留最近 N 轮]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[早期历史压缩为摘要]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[保留关键决策点]&#10;    C1 --&gt; F[注入到提示词]&#10;    D1 --&gt; F&#10;    E1 --&gt; F\">graph TD\n    A[完整对话历史] --&gt; B{历史管理策略}\n    B --&gt; C[滑动窗口]\n    B --&gt; D[摘要压缩]\n    B --&gt; E[选择性保留]\n    C --&gt; C1[保留最近 N 轮]\n    D --&gt; D1[早期历史压缩为摘要]\n    E --&gt; E1[保留关键决策点]\n    C1 --&gt; F[注入到提示词]\n    D1 --&gt; F\n    E1 --&gt; F</pre><p>三种对话历史管理策略：</p>\n<p><strong>滑动窗口法</strong>：保留最近 N 轮对话，丢弃更早的历史。简单高效，但可能丢失早期重要信息。</p>\n<p><strong>摘要压缩法</strong>：当历史超过阈值时，用模型将早期历史压缩为摘要。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"请将以下对话历史压缩为一段 100 字以内的摘要，保留关键决策和结论：&#10;&#10;[第 1-5 轮对话内容]&#10;&#10;摘要要求：&#10;- 保留所有技术决策及其理由&#10;- 保留用户的核心需求&#10;- 省略寒暄和重复确认&#10;- 保留代码方案的关键选择\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>请将以下对话历史压缩为一段 100 字以内的摘要，保留关键决策和结论：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[第 1-5 轮对话内容]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>摘要要求：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 保留所有技术决策及其理由</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 保留用户的核心需求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 省略寒暄和重复确认</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 保留代码方案的关键选择</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>选择性保留法</strong>：为每轮对话标记重要性，只保留重要对话轮次。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ConversationTurn {&#10;  role: &#39;user&#39; | &#39;assistant&#39;;&#10;  content: string;&#10;  importance: &#39;critical&#39; | &#39;normal&#39; | &#39;trivial&#39;;&#10;  tokens: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const selectHistory = (turns: ConversationTurn[], tokenBudget: number): ConversationTurn[] =&gt; {&#10;  const critical = turns.filter((t) =&gt; t.importance === &#39;critical&#39;);&#10;  const normal = turns.filter((t) =&gt; t.importance === &#39;normal&#39;);&#10;&#10;  let remaining = tokenBudget;&#10;  const selected: ConversationTurn[] = [];&#10;&#10;  for (const turn of critical) {&#10;    if (remaining &gt;= turn.tokens) {&#10;      selected.push(turn);&#10;      remaining -= turn.tokens;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const recentNormal = normal.slice(-6);&#10;  for (const turn of recentNormal) {&#10;    if (remaining &gt;= turn.tokens) {&#10;      selected.push(turn);&#10;      remaining -= turn.tokens;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return selected.sort((a, b) =&gt; turns.indexOf(a) - turns.indexOf(b));&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConversationTurn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  role</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'user'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'assistant'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  content</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  importance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'critical'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'normal'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'trivial'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<s