00 tokens（4%）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出预留：  4,000-8,000 tokens（6%）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>安全缓冲：  25,000+ tokens（20%）</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TokenBudget {&#10;  systemPrompt: number;&#10;  retrievalContext: number;&#10;  conversationHistory: number;&#10;  userInput: number;&#10;  outputReserve: number;&#10;  safetyBuffer: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const allocateBudget = (totalWindow: number, userInputTokens: number): TokenBudget =&gt; {&#10;  const systemPrompt = Math.min(2000, totalWindow * 0.015);&#10;  const outputReserve = Math.min(8000, totalWindow * 0.06);&#10;  const safetyBuffer = totalWindow * 0.2;&#10;  const userInput = userInputTokens;&#10;&#10;  const available = totalWindow - systemPrompt - outputReserve - safetyBuffer - userInput;&#10;  const retrievalContext = Math.floor(available * 0.65);&#10;  const conversationHistory = available - retrievalContext;&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    systemPrompt,&#10;    retrievalContext,&#10;    conversationHistory,&#10;    userInput,&#10;    outputReserve,&#10;    safetyBuffer,&#10;  };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TokenBudget</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  systemPrompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  retrievalContext</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-